  "scope": [
    "The fixture captures a live linked cut with two selected journal files, an alternate participant original and a standalone peer upload. It refuses an omitted discussion dependency and a missing selected file.",
    "The portable restore creates a fresh isolated room from the saved pin and earlier native parent. Cold reopen verifies exact selected journals, alternative journals, the standalone upload and the upload derived once from the selected participant.",
    "Independent source and installed SDKs reopen the exact selected and alternate originals offline and verify document and review Undo/Redo. The ordinary handover still verifies current authority, client and provider inputs separately.",
    "The bundle contains what was already held by the relay. Later local-only changes use ordinary client export and recovery. Earlier native ancestors remain a separate prerequisite."
  ]
